  "impact": {
    "en": "The Pauli exclusion principle is essential to understanding atomic structure, chemical bonding, and the stability of matter. His prediction of the neutrino opened an entire new field of particle physics. He was known for his sharp critical thinking, and the 'Pauli effect' became a humorous legend in physics.",
